Description: This repository contains the research compendium of the manuscript titled: "The Pleistocene-Holocene Transition in Tagua-Tagua Archeological Complex" submitted to Quaternary Science Reviews - Journal - Elsevier in 2021. 
  The compendium contains all data, code, analysis and text associated with this manuscript.
